046500     MOVE RCV-ITEM-NUMBER     TO VIEW-ITEM.
046600     MOVE RCV-QTY-DLVR          TO VIEW-QTY-DLVR.
046700     MOVE RCV-QTY-STORED        TO VIEW-QTY-STOR.
